**Results**:
- **App responsiveness**: No longer freezes; user can navigate to other screens
- **Battery life**: Improved (no long-held HTTP connections)
- **Completion rate**: Abandonment rate substantially reduced with async pattern
- **App store rating**: 2.8 stars → 4.5 stars
- **Mobile data usage**: Reduced through efficient polling versus connection-held retries
- **User satisfaction**: Positive reviews citing improved speed and responsiveness

